Story.danaNote = {
	style = "hand",
	text = [[If you found this, you heard them too. The keys.

Theo is upstairs. He says if we're quiet the host won't notice we're still here.

Don't wait by the front door. It doesn't open for us.

The furnace is warm, but the wall behind it is cold. Cold means outside.

— D.O.]],
}

Story.theoNote = {
	style = "hand",
	text = [[Day ?

Dana went down to the cellar an hour ago. Or a day ago. The sun is exactly where it was when we got here.

I counted the doors. I can hear him trying each one, one after another, all the way down the hall.

He doesn't knock. He doesn't have to.]],
}

